SVTRv2 visual encoder

The SVTRv2 LNConvTwo33 encoder in app/recognition/svtr_backbone.py is adapted
from Topdu/OpenOCR, source revision
1ccfc6ee6161f7133b192e16af3a9265273997ba, files
openrec/modeling/encoders/svtrv2_lnconv_two33.py and modeling/common.py.
The upstream operators and state-dict names are retained; the application
integration adds the Base dimensions and 384-to-512 projection.

